[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_desc]
“Muffinology” - Presented by Duchess of Cloudsdale, Derpy Hooves\nLecture Thirty Five, Batch Production of Muffins

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about muffins, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_TRUE_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YMuffins!§!: §YMake 10 Muffins§!.\nMake the decision §YMake a Muffin§! disappear.

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
Unlock decison in §YMuffins!§!: §YMake a Muffin§!.\nMake the decision §YMake 10 Muffins§! disappear.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_desc]
《马芬学讲座》——主讲者，云中城公爵，呆蹄\n第三十五节，论马芬的批量制作

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于马芬的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_TRUE_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y马芬！§!中的决议：§Y做10个马芬§!。\n让§Y做个马芬§!决议消失。

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_19_FALSE_TOOLTIP]
解锁§Y马芬！§!中的决议：§Y做个马芬§!。\n让§Y做10个马芬§!决议消失。

